{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t07.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t07.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t07_01",
      "hash64": "E7D193C3C4005204",
      "text": "欢迎来到采掘之镇——穴扎镇。\\n这里有很多辛勤工作的人。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t07_06",
      "hash64": "E7D192C3C4005051",
      "text": "虽然在大城市观光也不错，\\n但像这样朴素的镇子也是别有情调啊～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t07_07",
      "hash64": "E7D191C3C4004E9E",
      "text": "所谓“穴扎”就是打洞的意思。\\c\\n如同镇名一样，\\n多数居民都会靠采掘过日子。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t07_09",
      "hash64": "E7D18BC3C400446C",
      "text": "椅子的可贵之处……！\\n等你长大了就明白了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t07_11",
      "hash64": "E7CE0FC3C3FD3BE1",
      "text": "我在采掘场看到了\\n像山一样大的宝可梦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t07_12",
      "hash64": "E7CE0CC3C3FD36C8",
      "text": "我也看到了\\n像河一样长的宝可梦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t07_16",
      "hash64": "E7CE10C3C3FD3D94",
      "text": "小小象是地面属性！\\n不但电对它无效，而且它还克毒！\\r\\n……不要让它沾水哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t07_31",
      "hash64": "E7C783C3C3F7E24F",
      "text": "下班回家时，我会在那个对战场\\n和伙伴进行宝可梦对战。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t07_36",
      "hash64": "E7C780C3C3F7DD36",
      "text": "因为有大炭车在，\\n所以我也能更努力地工作。\\c\\n……不光是力气活儿，\\n在精神面上它也能为我提供帮助。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t07_42",
      "hash64": "E7C3FEC3C3F4CA79",
      "text": "当我在镇外快要倒下的时候，\\n一位野生的宝可梦中心的\\r\\n姐姐救了我。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t07_taxi",
      "hash64": "14FCCC1A9AE56123",
      "text": "怒鹦哥载你来趟空中之旅！\\n你平时会利用飞翔出租车吗？\\c\\n只要从地图App叫我来，\\n不管是哪我都会火速赶到。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
